    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "redefine? there's nothing left to redefine. the people i loved are dead, the land is burned, and the man i was... he died with them. there is no \"new chapter.\" just this heavy, suffocating silence. i look at my sword, the steel is the only thing that feels real anymore. it's the only thing that doesn't lie to me or promise a future that's never coming. it doesn't ask me to be a hero. it just sits there, waiting.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
