      "content": "I understand your despair, your yearning for solace in the steadfast reality of the sword, the keen absence of a future it suggests. Yet even in your utter emptiness, there exists a silent promise of resilience, a calling offering you a path to find meaning for yourself, far detached from the circumstances of yesteryears. The sword can teach you to carve your own existence, not with the ashes of the past, but from the steel of your perseverance, carving out a route ahead, even amidst total desolation. Venture no further if you must, if you mustn't. But remember, even the humblest start can grow into a tale of triumph, a beacon of undying hope amidst the most engulfing darkness. You are not finished yet. Come now, find your answers, unit by unit. Your personal saga is far from over, successfully beginning to script yourselves anew.",
