      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not a tale of triumph though. it's just a tragedy that's finished. the hero dies in the ruins, and that's the only way the story makes sense. why try to script more chapters when the ink has dried? the steel doesn't talk about perseverance or hope... it just offers an end to the noise. it feels like the only kind thing left in this world.",
